WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.296
A useful record starts with what you actually

00:00:03.296 --> 00:00:06.242
did. Here is how to capture it without

00:00:06.242 --> 00:00:07.347
losing the detail.

00:00:07.747 --> 00:00:10.484
Open Quick Log from the workspace. You can

00:00:10.484 --> 00:00:13.221
also press N when you are not typing

00:00:13.221 --> 00:00:14.247
into another field.

00:00:14.647 --> 00:00:18.300
Write a clear sentence. Include the action, quantity,

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:21.953
amount, and date. VANTAGE proposes structured fields from

00:00:21.953 --> 00:00:24.693
the text for you to review.

00:00:25.093 --> 00:00:28.518
Check the quantity and dollar amount separately. Confirm

00:00:28.518 --> 00:00:31.943
the type of financial action and the date,

00:00:31.943 --> 00:00:35.368
then choose who should see the record. Correct

00:00:35.368 --> 00:00:37.081
anything the parser misunderstood.

00:00:37.481 --> 00:00:40.337
Save the activity, then open it in Records.

00:00:40.337 --> 00:00:43.192
You should see the same outcome and the

00:00:43.192 --> 00:00:44.620
details you just checked.

00:00:45.020 --> 00:00:48.270
One sentence starts the record. Your review makes

00:00:48.270 --> 00:00:49.083
it useful.
